  "name": "DineLine 06 \u00b7 Post-Call Processing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 06 \u00b7 Post-call processing\nVapi sends call events here. End-of-call reports (transcript, recording, AI summary, cost) are saved to the DineLine call log with the outcome and agents involved.\n\nActivate and set the Production URL as `VAPI_EVENTS_URL` before running `npm run setup:vapi` (or keep the default, which posts straight to the app).",
